  "figures": {
    "mesh-near": {
      "caption": "Transport mesh in the solver's native (X,Y) coordinates with equal axis scaling in both panels. The Cartesian core contains 2,850 active nodes; the annulus contains 79,335. Blue and coral lines mark their active interiors. Both evolve in the shaded overlap. Gray dashed lines are the three-layer interpolation collars. The active annulus starts at r=0.810357; the dark line is the wall Y=0. Panel (a) retains the original overview window; the outlined ROI is magnified in (b), using the same Cartesian collar window as mesh-join (b). Filled colored points are active nodes and hollow gray points are ghosts. All mesh lines intersecting either window are shown; no donor links are inferred. The outer domain extends to r=10^10.",
      "caption_zh": "含时输运网格在求解器原生 (X,Y) 坐标中的近场图，两窗均横纵等比例。蓝色为张量核心的活动节点网格，珊瑚色为极坐标环带的活动节点网格；浅灰蓝底是两套活动自由度独立推进的重叠区。灰虚线为三层插值 ghost，黑线是壁面 Y=0。(a) 保留原概览窗口，框选区域在 (b) 等比例放大；彩色实心点为活动点，灰色空心点为 ghost。放大窗与 mesh-join (b) 相同；未画 donor 连线，未对窗口内网格线抽样。",
      "coordinates": "native, unwarped X,Y; equal aspect in both windows; no time-dependent coordinate conversion",
