    "mesh-join": {
      "caption": "Two native-coordinate magnifications of the real interpolation collars. (a) The three inward annular ghost rows receive values from active Cartesian donors. (b) The three top Cartesian ghost rows receive values from active annular donors. Filled blue/coral circles are active nodes; hollow gray circles are interpolation ghosts. Both axes use equal native-coordinate scaling within each panel. All visible nodes and lines are retained; the two panels show different windows. The 7-by-7 tensor interpolation stencils are not drawn.",
      "caption_zh": "原生 (X,Y) 坐标中真实接缝的两个等比例局部窗口。(a) 环带内侧三层 ghost 从活动张量核心取值；(b) 张量核心顶部三层 ghost 从活动环带取值。蓝/珊瑚实心点是活动节点，灰空心点是插值 ghost。显示窗口内全部节点和网格线；两窗覆盖不同区域，7×7 张量插值模板未画出。",
      "coordinates": "native X,Y; equal aspect within each of two windows",
      "size_inches": [
        8.2,
        4.4
      ],
