    "mesh-global": {
      "caption": "The full transport mesh under the display-only radial transform r=sqrt(X^2+Y^2), s=log10(1+r), (xi,upsilon)=s(cos(theta),sin(theta)). This is a mapped view. All 618 retained annular radial rows and 129 angular columns are drawn, reaching r=10^10. The small blue patch is the same Cartesian core under the same transform. Three fine leaders identify exact native-coordinate radii 10^2, 10^6 and 10^10; these labels are geometric references, not replacement mesh rows. The stronger outer contour is the actual last exported radial row. Redistribution preserves r<=4 and uses a configured tail density factor of 2 (realized 1.998331), with full refinement from r=20; no density field or time trajectory was computed to make this figure.",
      "caption_zh": "全域输运网格使用仅用于显示的径向变换 s=log10(1+r)，(ξ,υ)=s(cosθ,sinθ)，其中 r=√(X²+Y²)，不代表原生坐标等比例。完整保留环带所有径向行和角向列，外边界 r=10^10。蓝色小片为同一变换下的张量核心。径向加密保留 r≤4，r≥20 的尾部加密配置为 2 倍，实际密度比 1.998331；三条细引线标出原生半径 10²、10⁶、10¹⁰ 的位置，不替代实际网格行。较强外轮廓取自实际最外层径向网格行；本图未推进物理场。",
      "coordinates": "xi=log10(1+r)*cos(theta), upsilon=log10(1+r)*sin(theta); display transform only",
