    "mesh-poisson": {
      "caption": "The independent spectral Poisson discretization. (a) Native near field, with equal axis scaling: Chebyshev tensor core in blue and spectral annulus in coral. (b) The complete annulus in (theta,t=log r) coordinates, showing all 34 radial panels of degree 20 and angular degree 80. Graphite dashed lines are actual panel boundaries; adjoining panels share their endpoint node, where derivative continuity is imposed. Every exported grid line is retained. These are distinct from the finite-difference transport grids.",
      "caption_zh": "独立的谱 Poisson 网格。(a) 等比例原生 (X,Y) 近场：蓝色 Chebyshev 张量核心，珊瑚色谱环带；(b) (θ,t=log r) 坐标下的完整环带。石墨色虚线为实际径向分片边界，相邻片共享端点并施加导数连续条件。未抽样网格线；此网格与输运差分网格相互独立。",
